WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.310
A blank exam page.

2
00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:05.250
A poem you've never seen fades in.

3
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:11.960
It begins: "Here is the ancient floor,
Footworn and hollowed and thin," A timer

4
00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:14.200
starts: twenty minutes.

5
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:19.020
Your pen hovers over the first line,
ready to label every technique.

6
00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:20.390
Then it stops.

7
00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:24.270
With a poem you've never seen,
what should you look for first?

8
00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:27.830
In this mission, you'll learn a short
routine for the first few minutes,

9
00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:29.700
before you write a word.

10
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.760
Label every technique from the top?

11
00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:33.400
Look up the poet's life?

12
00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:35.520
You'll test what each one gives you.

13
00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:38.100
And you'll try your
routine on Hardy's poem,

14
00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:39.400
against the clock.

15
00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:42.550
Your mission: work out
what to look for first.
